OL,3,GNEWSAHGVs could be permanently banned
OL,4,Afrom 'wonky' road
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorries could be permanently banned
OL,7,Ffrom a route once dubbed Britain's
OL,8,F'wonkiest road' to safeguard cyclists
OL,9,Fand other road users.
OL,11,FWiltshire Council has proposed a 7.5
OL,12,Ftonne weight restriction on sections of
OL,13,Fthe B4069, and several other rural
OL,14,Froads.
OL,16,FA council document states the use of a
OL,17,Flarge numbers of HGVs on these narrow
OL,18,Froutes increases risks to cyclists and
OL,19,Fother road users, while accelerating
OL,20,Fthe deterioration of the carriageway.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
