OL,3,GNEWSAHGVs could be permanently banned
OL,4,Afrom 'wonky' road
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Allison Bucknell said:
OL,7,F"Every day I'm getting complaints about
OL,8,Fthe number of HGVs going through
OL,9,FLyneham, particularly through Lyneham
OL,10,FBanks. "
